---
import SiteShell from '../layouts/SiteShell.astro';
---

<SiteShell
  title="Pricing"
  description="A persistent AI Outfitter resident with metered inference."
>
  <main class="site-frame pricing-page">
    <header class="pricing-hero">
      <p class="eyebrow">Resident agents</p>
      <h1>Put an agent on the work.</h1>
      <p>Start with issue triage, keep the resident available between tasks, and pay for the inference it actually uses.</p>
    </header>

    <section class="pricing-grid" aria-label="Monthly subscriptions">
      <article class="pricing-card">
        <p class="pricing-card__label">Resident</p>
        <p class="pricing-card__price"><span>$20</span> / month</p>
        <p>One persistent resident for one GitHub organization. It starts with issue triage and uses reviewable, organization-owned configuration.</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Issue triage included</li>
          <li>Inference billed at published provider cost plus 20% markup</li>
          <li>$100 monthly inference budget; new work stops after recorded usage reaches it</li>
          <li>Promotion codes can waive markup without discounting inference cost</li>
          <li>Enterprise Pensieve auditability opens after its complete-trace acceptance is proven</li>
        </ul>
        <form action="/api/billing/checkout" method="post">
          <input type="hidden" name="tier" value="resident" />
          <label class="promotion-field">
            <span>Promotion code</span>
            <input name="promotion_code" type="text" autocomplete="off" maxlength="32" placeholder="Optional" />
          </label>
          <button class="pricing-card__action" type="submit">Get a resident</button>
        </form>
      </article>

      <article class="pricing-card pricing-card--team">
        <p class="pricing-card__label">Resident fleet</p>
        <p class="pricing-card__price"><span>$200</span> / month</p>
        <p>Multiple collaborating residents with explicit concurrency, support, and spending controls.</p>
        <p class="pricing-card__availability">Coming after the single-resident contract is proven.</p>
        <span class="pricing-card__action pricing-card__action--disabled" aria-disabled="true">Fleet checkout is not open yet</span>
      </article>
    </section>

    <p class="pricing-note">Stripe hosts checkout and recurring billing. Provider cost and the 20% markup remain visible as separate invoice items. NO-MARKUP waives only the markup. In-flight usage can settle above the monthly budget.</p>
  </main>
</SiteShell>

<style>
  .pricing-page {
    padding-block: clamp(4rem, 9vw, 8rem);
  }

  .pricing-hero {
    max-width: 48rem;
  }

  h1 {
    max-width: 10ch;
    margin-block: 0.7rem 1rem;
    font-size: clamp(3.2rem, 9vw, 7rem);
    letter-spacing: -0.065em;
    line-height: 0.9;
  }

  .pricing-hero > p:last-child {
    max-width: 40rem;
    color: var(--site-muted);
    font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 2vw, 1.35rem);
    line-height: 1.55;
  }

  .pricing-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 1px;
    margin-top: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 6rem);
    padding: 1px;
    background: var(--site-line);
  }

  .pricing-card {
    display: flex;
    min-height: 25rem;
    flex-direction: column;
    padding: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 3rem);
    background: var(--site-canvas);
  }

  .pricing-card--team {
    box-shadow: inset 0 3px 0 var(--site-signal);
  }

  .pricing-card__label {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--site-signal);
    font-family: var(--site-font-mono);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .pricing-card__price {
    margin-block: 1.8rem 1.2rem;
    color: var(--site-muted);
    font-family: var(--site-font-mono);
  }

  .pricing-card__price span {
    color: var(--site-text);
    font-family: inherit;
    font-size: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 5.5rem);
    font-weight: 750;
    letter-spacing: -0.07em;
  }

  .pricing-card > p:not(.pricing-card__label, .pricing-card__price) {
    max-width: 31rem;
    color: var(--site-muted);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .pricing-card ul {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.65rem;
    padding-left: 1.2rem;
    color: var(--site-muted);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .pricing-card__availability {
    margin-top: auto;
    padding-top: 2rem;
    font-family: var(--site-font-mono);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .pricing-card form {
    margin-top: auto;
    padding-top: 2.5rem;
  }

  .promotion-field {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--site-dim);
    font-family: var(--site-font-mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .promotion-field input {
    border: 1px solid var(--site-line);
    border-radius: 0;
    padding: 0.85rem 0.9rem;
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--site-text);
    font: inherit;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  }

  .promotion-field input:focus-visible {
    border-color: var(--site-signal);
    outline: 1px solid var(--site-signal);
  }

  .pricing-card__action {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    border: 1px solid var(--site-signal);
    border-radius: 0;
    padding: 1rem 1.2rem;
    background: var(--site-signal);
    color: var(--site-ink);
    cursor: pointer;
    font: inherit;
    font-size: 0.76rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.09em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    text-align: center;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .pricing-card__action:hover,
  .pricing-card__action:focus-visible {
    border-color: var(--site-signal-high);
    background: var(--site-signal-high);
  }

  .pricing-card__action--disabled,
  .pricing-card__action--disabled:hover {
    border-color: var(--site-line);
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--site-dim);
    cursor: default;
  }

  .pricing-note {
    margin-top: 1.2rem;
    color: var(--site-dim);
    font-size: 0.82rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 44rem) {
    .pricing-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .pricing-card {
      min-height: 22rem;
    }
  }
</style>
